{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15104160","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15104160","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1510416001:1":{"text":"Perseus, you've returned.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，你回来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4BDD1D23524C870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510416002:1":{"text":"Lygos, these are the mages I brought back to help Halia with our crisis.","source_cn":"隆尔，这些人是我请回来帮呼临城解决危机的魔法师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADBCFFB2629A69FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510416003:1":{"text":"Yeah, I've heard of these mages and their tricks... Why is there a filthy Wildborn with you?","source_cn":"哼，我听说过，在城外耍魔术把戏的人……那个肮脏的小兽人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D520B27D6B7DA87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510416004:1":{"text":"I am Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>'s servant.","source_cn":"加拉是<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCC84E2387BE7F537","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I am Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>'s servant.","female":"I am Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>'s servant.","variant_male_record_index":"180247","variant_female_record_index":"180248","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510416005:1":{"text":"Silence, furspawn! I wasn't talking to you!","source_cn":"闭嘴，野兽！我没和你说话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x754D4C7424EB2D64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510416006:0":{"text":"By the gods, Perseus! You're trusting these brutes?! They're nothing but savages. You can't just let any of them into the city!","source_cn":"怎么回事，珀尔修斯，你又开始相信兽人了？他们就是一群没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBB0498E4C28470F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510416007:0":{"text":"Enough! These mages saved our men at Mirehold. This is my decision.","source_cn":"够了！这些魔法师救治过水泽营地的兄弟，别质疑我的决定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0C77D8388139754","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510416008:0":{"text":"Merlin, I need to go inform <style=\"highlight\">Regulus Abundius</style> about what happened and get permission for you to cast magic in the city.","source_cn":"魔法师们，我去通报<style=highlight>阿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D09FD8D738C652","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510416009:0":{"text":"Please wait here. If you have any questions, please ask Lygos.","source_cn":"在那之前，你们先在城内等待。有任何事情可以问隆尔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B646ACEA177E05E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510416010:1":{"text":"Lygos, help them but mind your own business. That's an order.","source_cn":"隆尔，管好你自己。这是军令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11596A02CBC9A2E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510416011:1":{"text":"Yes, sir...","source_cn":"……是。<key:dialog4>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8A55D8A9B79DB93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:1510416012:0":{"text":"As Perseus departs, Lygos turns his scrutiny upon the group, his eyes sharp with silent reproach.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯离开后，隆尔用不满的目光上下打量着你们","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7777B6ADC190979A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510416013:0":{"text":"An order, huh?","source_cn":"哼，军令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA0CCACED50F4D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510416014:1":{"text":"Well, let's go into the city.","source_cn":"进城吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B10DC0AB6D8CD50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_rec